## 1. Problem

<!-- 2-3 sentences. Who has what problem, when, and what it costs them to live with it.
     NO solution language — not a single feature may be named in this section. -->

**Who:** <!-- the specific person, in their context of use -->

**Problem:** <!-- what is painful, in their words if you have quotes -->

**Cost of leaving it unsolved:** <!-- time lost, money lost, users lost, risk taken -->

**Evidence:** <!-- support tickets, analytics, interviews, churn data. If you only have a hunch, say so: [hunch] -->

**Why now:** <!-- what changed that makes this worth doing this quarter -->

> **Done when:** a stranger can read this section and tell you what "solved" would mean,
> without you naming a single feature.

